===============================================================================
  MyHealthOpinions — Patients mail system v1  ("Health Pulse")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 07. Consent required
  File       : consent-required.liquid
  Class      : Consent — transactional, no unsubscribe
  Trigger    : Account active, but no consent record for the current terms version
  Replaces   : new — replaces MFR parent-consent.liquid (MHO members are 18+)

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Please review and sign your panel terms
    2. {{ user.name.first }}, one step before your first invitation
    3. Action needed: your Patients consent

  PREHEADER
    About 5 minutes, in plain language. Invitations start as soon as it is signed.

  PLAIN-TEXT PART
    dist/text/consent-required.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.

  Generated from src/content/templates.js + src/design/ — edit those and run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
